{"title":"2005 AIME I Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Solution_5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 5</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Quadrilateral\" title=\"Quadrilateral\">quadrilateral</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/f/90fbb04e563273a77cf45755c6389bca6abefb01.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD,\\ BC=8,\\ CD=12,\\ AD=10,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"309\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/c/02cdb684a60562fd7bcfacd6381b21dcd3863b24.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m\\angle A= m\\angle B = 60^\\circ.$\" width=\"163\" height=\"13\" /> Given that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/c/cfc1c5345444a3cab95f1ebf8e1711858b346aef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB = p + \\sqrt{q},$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"112\" height=\"18\" /> where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/1/0615acc3725de21025457e7d6f7694dab8e2f758.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> are <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Positive\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Positive\">positive</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Integer\" title=\"Integer\">integers</a>, find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/3/043f651be7ed631a58104b324d1aa6c6c843beba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p+q.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/b/1bbf437694cfea9d7049c523e552fb18592a1f17.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy]draw((0,0)--(20.87,0)--(15.87,8.66)--(5,8.66)--cycle); draw((5,8.66)--(5,0)); draw((15.87,8.66)--(15.87,0)); draw((5,8.66)--(16.87,6.928)); label(&quot;$A$&quot;,(0,0),SW); label(&quot;$B$&quot;,(20.87,0),SE); label(&quot;$E$&quot;,(15.87,8.66),NE); label(&quot;$D$&quot;,(5,8.66),NW); label(&quot;$P$&quot;,(5,0),S); label(&quot;$Q$&quot;,(15.87,0),S); label(&quot;$C$&quot;,(16.87,7),E); label(&quot;$12$&quot;,(10.935,7.794),S); label(&quot;$10$&quot;,(2.5,4.5),W); label(&quot;$10$&quot;,(18.37,4.5),E); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"135\" />\n</p><p>Draw line segment <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/5/6d5c9afa92ae3180f02754c177e530d9d0f8b4d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DE$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> such that line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/5/6d5c9afa92ae3180f02754c177e530d9d0f8b4d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DE$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> is concurrent with line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c52a41dcbd739f1d026c5d4f181438b75b76976.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" />. Then, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/8/a68eca3ba7f3e3a5f5b07a373f664d66e17f9d91.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABED$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> is an isosceles trapezoid so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/a/d6a3972ae17499982ab31f3cd1e033573fd6d682.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD=BE=10$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"124\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/f/dafb324902af9772751731e815ab84e05f4efcb7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC=8$\" width=\"61\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/9/999913ef6f5daba31804293712ca9a559d572f63.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$EC=2$\" width=\"61\" height=\"12\" />. We are given that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/f/b9f476d54e7646df2ec0a8ac3abbd926fee29e89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DC=12$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"71\" height=\"13\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/e/a8e70bdbc32bb61b38164b057cb050c24bab5871.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle CED = 120^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"118\" height=\"15\" />, using Law of Cosines on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/d/22d521d89ef27d4fdbd321d0eb908b5209fd7090.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\bigtriangleup CED$\" width=\"60\" height=\"13\" /> gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/d/04da8bb1c6e6285b1ea88fc3135152c8b3402857.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[12^2=DE^2+4-2(2)(DE)(\\cos 120^{\\circ})\\]\" width=\"291\" height=\"19\" /> which gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/6/4062429bda5b8c872466036deb21eb76a45a4150.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[144-4=DE^2+2DE\\]\" width=\"180\" height=\"16\" />. Adding <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to both sides gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/9/5e936d3bfc5c100261de919cf50aa69fe68508ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$141=(DE+1)^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"133\" height=\"19\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/e/84e36136f718e00010056ffcfb3e628f3f1feac7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DE=\\sqrt{141}-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"130\" height=\"21\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/6/14655638b72f52793fe3b7130c0f81ea5e98cb97.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\bigtriangleup DAP$\" width=\"59\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/6/d962245c42337c6f4f82c788bb6b19220c274493.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\bigtriangleup EBQ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"59\" height=\"17\" /> are both <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/c/47c78b85058ee5e17f88e2cde302e48aad826b35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30-60-90$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"101\" height=\"15\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/b/03b317ce3508ee6fd7a08a1a9d8461c33e000d95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AP=5$\" width=\"60\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/6/8f6306a40ac8960650ae41d81fe86de779efef39.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BQ=5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"62\" height=\"16\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/b/53bd856e8a6fd903465f7c480bec45e36fca8a6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PQ=DE$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"82\" height=\"16\" />, and therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/e/b7eecdd6b74e4bbb44e9cb14be8c8077112db015.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB=AP+PQ+BQ=5+\\sqrt{141}-1+5=9+\\sqrt{141} \\rightarrow (p,q)=(9,141) \\rightarrow \\boxed{150}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"659\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<center><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AIME_2005I_Solution_7_1.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/4/41/AIME_2005I_Solution_7_1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"234\" height=\"112\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span></center>\n<p>Draw the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Perpendicular\" title=\"Perpendicular\">perpendiculars</a> from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" />, labeling the intersection points as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/5/a055f405829e64a3b70253ab67cb45ed6ed5bb29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />. This forms 2 <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/c/47c78b85058ee5e17f88e2cde302e48aad826b35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30-60-90$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"101\" height=\"15\" /> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Right_triangle\" title=\"Right triangle\">right triangles</a>, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/0/080b87b3042a7d4dc64f6cee8e9b8b63e343021e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AE = 5$\" width=\"61\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/d/45d6637337587bd8396431d15b0de944d3aeb0d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BF = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"62\" height=\"13\" />. Also, if we draw the horizontal line extending from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> to a point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/2/6e28ce12d49d39f160d5a0ef54077fc98e4b9d2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$G$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> on the line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/5/6d5c9afa92ae3180f02754c177e530d9d0f8b4d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DE$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" />, we find another right triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/7/f27bcc003b15aafb8ce541b0115225871670ccdc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle DGC$\" width=\"60\" height=\"13\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/2/8f2c0e26fea7d2cf59bd5f54c5ae4d7b361ab790.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DG = DE - CF = 5\\sqrt{3} - 4\\sqrt{3} = \\sqrt{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"297\" height=\"18\" />. The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Pythagorean_Theorem\" title=\"Pythagorean Theorem\">Pythagorean Theorem</a> yields that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/7/1b794b4ae2f264d5f5c1b34d651ce60f0130ae3d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$GC^2 = 12^2 - \\sqrt{3}^2 = 141$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"190\" height=\"22\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/5/d35dabe4f212d2a7adc38836ce49754b31e376fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$EF = GC = \\sqrt{141}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"148\" height=\"18\" />. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/4/454b3dd2e7a1cdc4c3209409fa5eb842be743e88.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB = 5 + 4 + \\sqrt{141} = 9 + \\sqrt{141}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"256\" height=\"18\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/4/0542ada9249d42ad765378038aba1bcf714044b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p + q = \\boxed{150}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"104\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<center><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AIME_2005I_Solution_7_2.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/2/2f/AIME_2005I_Solution_7_2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"234\" height=\"204\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span></center>\n<p>Extend <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/5/bc56862b1fdb71204894da278e42ef75de73a40b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c52a41dcbd739f1d026c5d4f181438b75b76976.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> to an intersection at point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />. We get an <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Equilateral_triangle\" title=\"Equilateral triangle\">equilateral triangle</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/8/fd85454c0ce4000c0e63b4a1c4a12ef6f8b56e9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABE$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />. We denote the length of a side of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/5/9057d4d264f5530ac63d366089bc3c17ce5d79a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABE$\" width=\"58\" height=\"13\" /> as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/7/f37bba504894945c07a32f5496d74299a37aa51c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> and solve for it using the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Law_of_Cosines\" title=\"Law of Cosines\">Law of Cosines</a>: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/d/c2d267f767804bf3bd39941692aeba42fd97a999.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[12^2 = (s - 10)^2 + (s - 8)^2 - 2(s - 10)(s - 8)\\cos{60}\\]\" width=\"398\" height=\"19\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/c/72c8eaac07f971c4b517db5481326b8765930c76.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[144 = 2s^2 - 36s + 164 - (s^2 - 18s + 80)\\]\" width=\"313\" height=\"19\" /> This simplifies to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/3/bc3c55ee83a59338dd690e5c4653401ad7b30bcd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s^2 - 18s - 60=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"138\" height=\"15\" />; the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Quadratic_formula\" title=\"Quadratic formula\">quadratic formula</a> yields the (discard the negative result) same result of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/0/080ccdb3e97ec17bdc802e808843666eca9ebea9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9 + \\sqrt{141}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"74\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Extend <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c52a41dcbd739f1d026c5d4f181438b75b76976.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/5/bc56862b1fdb71204894da278e42ef75de73a40b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> to meet at point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, forming an equilateral triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/5/9057d4d264f5530ac63d366089bc3c17ce5d79a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABE$\" width=\"58\" height=\"13\" />. Draw a line from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> parallel to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> so that it intersects <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/5/bc56862b1fdb71204894da278e42ef75de73a40b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> at point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/5/a055f405829e64a3b70253ab67cb45ed6ed5bb29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />. Then, apply <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Stewart%27s_Theorem\" title=\"Stewart&#39;s Theorem\">Stewart's Theorem</a> on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/3/803aa1ba74919a869eee5f679bb42af62b79d343.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle CFE$\" width=\"58\" height=\"13\" />. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/3/8038f503f701831c8b770077645fd6b515dbc4ba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CE=x$\" width=\"63\" height=\"12\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/2/d02a599e57533e7b5ef3ecf315b88dc5262e2e80.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2x(x-2) + 12^2x = 2x^2 + x^2(x-2)\\]\" width=\"278\" height=\"19\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/1/26188645723b907de148b80ec31fed400b3ab0cf.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^3 - 2x^2 - 140x = 0\\]\" width=\"159\" height=\"15\" /> By the quadratic formula (discarding the negative result), <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/f/cdff1b59b9d26e5371990aad46b712e12f2fcf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 1 + \\sqrt{141}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"108\" height=\"18\" />, giving <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/c/c9cecbb79717cc39f6bbafc0bb8ba9f403d51015.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB = 9 + \\sqrt{141}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"126\" height=\"18\" /> for a final answer of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/6/70674590ee0227717e4fb51c7b38760a34207423.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p+q=150$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"92\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_5\">Solution 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Draw a line from point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> to a new point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/5/bc56862b1fdb71204894da278e42ef75de73a40b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> parallel to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" />. Draw a line from point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> to a new point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/5/a055f405829e64a3b70253ab67cb45ed6ed5bb29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> parallel to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/4/0948661e822f2a953c43a57ac9e40b2734476de4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" />. This creates parallelogram <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/c/6aca4694f47bf14bfe8136fe16a1e4ed7d663f13.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CEFB$\" width=\"57\" height=\"12\" />. \n</p>\n<pre> The reasoning for this is to connect the two angles that are congruent. \n</pre>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/f/1ff962956154edc72be06e89e85d7ea5ffa0f59c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle CEF = 60^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"108\" height=\"15\" /> and triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/c/58cf2c01b32821ad23584e33cc96ba86963d7961.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AEF$\" width=\"42\" height=\"13\" /> is an equilateral triangle with side length 8. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/1/2f11fd78e70b9f9143c3d617e4faf959966a46c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AF = 8$\" width=\"60\" height=\"13\" />. \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/a/daabc48ef1bc86054eafd65eaf634d33dfd25224.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ED = 10 - 8 = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"139\" height=\"16\" />. By the Law of Cosines, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/7/0c74c1bc1b71d18edd042ffd498ce98a9a3509c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CD^2 = ED^2 + EC^2 - 2 \\cdot {ED} \\cdot {EC} \\cdot \\cos{\\angle DEC}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"373\" height=\"18\" />. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/e/ddea36f119dbb592771cf85ec2adff0f204d9e3f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$144 = 4 + c^2 - 2c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"139\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/e/18e1557cb202a8f056b883d97a7fbb52af54a92f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = 1 + \\sqrt{141}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"108\" height=\"21\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/7/d27f3fc1df47665b9ca1d857e2939ebe77eb60cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$EC = FB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"84\" height=\"14\" />. \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/f/d1f74baaba3bc5710c4a7e7c18e86766491507df.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB = AF + FB = 8 + 1 + \\sqrt{141} = 9 + \\sqrt{141}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"361\" height=\"21\" /> so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/6/70674590ee0227717e4fb51c7b38760a34207423.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p+q=150$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"92\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p>-unhappyfarmer\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AIME_I\" title=\"2005 AIME I\">2005 AIME I</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AIME_I_Problems\" title=\"2005 AIME I Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AIME_I_Answer_Key\" title=\"2005 AIME I Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2005\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2005 AIME I Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2005 AIME I Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2005 AIME I Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2005 AIME I Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2005 AIME I Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2005 AIME I Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2005 AIME I Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2005 AIME I Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2005 AIME I Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2005 AIME I Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2005 AIME I Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2005 AIME I Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2005 AIME I Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2005 AIME I Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2005 AIME I Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2005 AIME I Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017204303\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.057 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.081 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 552/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1786/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 108/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 16385/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.973      1 -total\n 58.98%    7.652      1 Template:AIME_box\n 38.69%    5.019      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:2660:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017204303 and revision id 287167. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}